salt
{
  <b>SURFACE: USD SWAPTION VOL (USD.RATES.VOL)</b> | [ Back to curves and surfaces ]
  --
  {
    Surface | ^USD.RATES.VOL^
    Series | oresmd://vol/USD?type=surface&instrument=swaption
    Asset class | rates
    Derivation | volatility (candidate, not published)
    As of | "2026-10-06 16:00" | [ Choose as-of ]
  }
  {#
    Market quotes | Quote (oresmd_uri) | Value | Source | Observed at
    . | ir/USD ... tenor=1Y term=1Y | 21.4% | synthetic.v1.tick.vol | 16:00
    . | ir/USD ... tenor=1Y term=5Y | 19.8% | synthetic.v1.tick.vol | 16:00
    . | ir/USD ... tenor=5Y term=5Y | 18.1% | synthetic.v1.tick.vol | 16:00
  }
  [ Refresh from market ]
  --
  {
    Axes | ^(not modelled)^ | Parameterisation | ^(not modelled)^
    Quoting convention | ^(not modelled)^ | Model | ^(not modelled)^
  }
  [ Calibrate candidate ]
  --
  {#
    Calibration error | Slice | Residual | RMSE | Flag
    . | (no calibration engine) | - | - | not served
  }
  --
  {#
    Slices | Tenor | ATM vol | 25d RR | 25d BF
    . | (no slice read) | - | - | -
  }
  --
  Candidate only | not published — pricing still reads the published surface
  --
  [ Arrange approval ] | [ Leave unpublished ]
}

